# Raw per-call model outputs and live process state of lexicon runs stay on disk, out of git
# (owner, 2026-11-24). Each run's questions, answers, receipts, ledgers and reports are its
# committed record; the per-call outputs they summarize are not, and git history keeps every byte.
docs/readings/**/ssl-responses-*-call_*.log
docs/readings/**/ssl-responses-*-call_*-output.json
docs/readings/**/ssl-responses-*-response.json
docs/readings/**/*.pid
docs/readings/**/*.lock
docs/readings/**/*.sample
